  type_alias_err_unit_var.pcpp - break step of type_alias.pcpp:
  an alias of a unit's exported variable: GUnitCount is not a type (SM0013, at the qualified name)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\type_alias_err_unit_var.pcpp
